# The admin panel ships as a template and reads NO build-time credentials.
#
# The owner enters the Supabase and Cloudinary details once in the Settings
# screen; they are encrypted with a passphrase (AES-GCM via WebCrypto) and
# kept in that browser only.
#
# The Cloudinary unsigned upload preset especially must never be baked into
# a public bundle — anyone holding it can upload to your account.
#
# This file is intentionally empty of values.
